<title>ST VINCENT: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 249-9 V INDIA IN 3RD ONE-DAYER.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 249-9 V INDIA IN 3RD ONE-DAYER.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies scored 249-9 off their 50 overs in the third one-day international against India at Arnos Vale on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
